// Aethelgard_Ruins - ambience chamber (name=engine_sound in World.ozone).
//
// IMPORTANT: Main.cpp deliberately skips ZONE_GAMEPLAY_SOUND (and ZONE_SKY) when
// dispatching LightningScript on_enter/on_exit, so this def's message never
// fires. That is not a data bug. Note also that ZoneNode::soundProfile is not
// populated from world data at all today, so this zone is currently silent - the
// def is kept so the world round-trips and so the profile has somewhere to live
// once authoring exists.
entity "engine_sound" : skyzone {
    actions {
        on_enter {
            say "Entered the ambience chamber"
        }
    }
}
